=== HOW TO READ THIS ===
Respondents clearly differ in their baseline enthusiasm. Whether they differ
in their SENSITIVITY to the cues is a question this design cannot answer:
with three answers per person there is almost nothing left to estimate an
individual slope from, and the third specification is saturated by
construction - each person sees each cue exactly once, so a per-person level
for each cue would need as many parameters as there are observations.
This is a limit of the experiment, not evidence that everybody reacts alike.
Answering it needs several apps per cue per respondent.
